CRON_JOB|`Choose a supported application job code.`
CRON_JOB_EXISTS|`A task already uses this job code.`
CRON_EDIT_RUNNING|`Wait for the current run before editing this task.`
CRON_CHANGED|`The task changed or started running. Reload and try again.`
CRON_BULK_CHANGED|`Some tasks were kept. Reload to check for running or changed tasks. Permanent deletion is unavailable for application tasks. Restore them from the Deleted view.`
CRON_RUNNER_DISABLED|`The task runner is disabled in this build.`
CRON_RESUME_BEFORE_RUN|`Revise or resume this schedule before requesting a run.`
CRON_PAUSE_FAILED|`The task could not be paused. Reload and try again.`
CRON_RESUME_FAILED|`The task could not be resumed. Check its schedule and current state.`
CRON_RECOVER_FAILED|`Confirm the worker has stopped and reload the task if its state changed.`
CRON_QUEUED|`Queued`
CRON_ALREADY_QUEUED|`Already queued/running`
CRON_PAUSED|`Paused`
CRON_RESTORE_FAILED|`Only idle, deleted application tasks can be restored.`
CRON_RESTORED|`Task restored as paused.`
CRON_RESUMED|`Resumed`
CRON_RECOVERED|`Interrupted run recorded as uncertain. The task is paused.`
CRON_STATUS|`Choose a valid schedule status.`
CRON_NO_FUTURE|`No future occurrence fits this schedule and its start/end bounds.`
CRON_INVALID|`Enter a valid five-field cron expression or a supported alias such as @daily.`
CRON_END|`The end must be later than the start.`
CRON_ZONE|`Choose a valid recurrence timezone.`
CRON_BOUND|`Enter a valid start/end date and time in your timezone.`
CRON_RUNNING|`Running`
CRON_COMPLETED|`Completed`
CRON_INTERRUPTED|`Execution interrupted. Verify the external outcome before requesting another run.`
CRON_OUTCOME_UNAVAILABLE|`Execution outcome unavailable.`
CRON_REPORT_GENERATION_FAILED|`Report generation failed before sending.`
CRON_HANDLER_FAILED|`Task handler failed.`
CRON_BAD_REPORT_IDENTITY|`The task's report identity is invalid.`
CRON_UNKNOWN_HANDLER|`Unknown task handler code.`
running|`Running`
succeeded|`Succeeded`
failed|`Failed`
uncertain|`Uncertain`
